  <extension url="http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-artifactComment">
    <extension url="type">
      <valueCode value="documentation"/>
    </extension>
    <extension url="text">
      <valueMarkdown value="Maintenance search expression: `multiaxial_descendantsof:(LP14546-3 OR LP71230-4) AND system:urine`. The compose anchors at two trunk LP codes - LP14546-3 and LP71230-4 - using `concept is-a` filters scoped to SYSTEM=LP7681-2 (urine) and CLASSTYPE=1 (lab test). To regenerate: re-run the search expression as a LOINC hierarchy query, add any newly-discovered trunk LP code as another is-a filter, then re-expand."/>
    </extension>
  </extension>
